From: MythicLand <mythicland@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 08 Nov 2026 20:52:44 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Predict fast grounded player tracking positions

Reduce visible approach lag with a bounded lead in regular position
updates. Keep movement and combat authoritative on the server, and clear
the lead across discontinuities and blocked paths.


